Features added on top of the referenced code:

  - Rebuilt the panel as a gated four-stage pipeline (brief / script / assets / compose),
    each stage written as an artifact that can park at an approval gate.
  - Added configurable image / video / voice HTTP providers alongside the ComfyUI workflows.
  - Added the xAI Grok Imagine video protocol (request_id polling, aspect-ratio mapping,
    data-URI reference frames, authenticated result download).
  - Added TXT/MD novel import with automatic paragraph and shot segmentation.
  - Added editing versions (cuts), subtitle styling, and per-section pause / trim controls.
  - Added bilingual UI (Chinese / English).

